                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 92,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "**Why prioritize taint mode?** Pattern matching finds syntax but misses context. A pattern `eval($X)` matches both `eval(user_input)` (vulnerable) and `eval(\"safe_literal\")` (safe). Taint mode tracks data flow, so it only alerts when untrusted data actually reaches the sink\u2014dramatically reducing false positives for injection vulnerabilities."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
